## ASAM Unrestricted Distribution Clause

Each ASAM OpenX standard published on publications.pages.asam.net contains
the following disclaimer (standard name varies):

> "This document is the copyrighted property of ASAM e.V. In alteration to
> the regular license terms (https://www.asam.net/license), ASAM allows
> unrestricted distribution of this standard. §2 (1) of ASAM's regular
> license terms is therefore substituted by the following clause:
> 'The licensor grants everyone a basic, non-exclusive and unlimited
> license to use the standard ASAM [StandardName]'."

This clause applies to the following standards in this repository:

- ASAM OpenDRIVE® v1.9.0
- ASAM OpenSCENARIO® DSL v2.2.0
- ASAM OpenODD® v1.0.0
- ASAM OpenLABEL® v1.0.0
- ASAM OpenMATERIAL® 3D BS 1.0.0

